@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy — SAT Jewel";
}

<div class="sat-legal-page-wrap">
    <!-- Header Banner -->
    <div class="sat-legal-banner">
        <div class="sat-legal-banner-inner">
            <span class="sat-legal-badge">Legal & Security</span>
            <h1 class="sat-legal-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p class="sat-legal-subtitle">How Sat Jewels collects, protects, utilizes, and respects your personal data across our services.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sat-legal-container">

        <!-- Section 1 -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading">Section 1 - Collection of Personal Data</h2>
            <p>When you make a purchase from Sat Jewels, we gather essential details provided by you, such as your full name, shipping address, and email address, to facilitate the fulfillment of your order. Additionally, when you explore our store, our systems automatically log your device's Internet Protocol (IP) address to help us analyze browser preferences and system compatibility. With your permission, we may occasionally email you updates about new jewelry arrivals, exclusive collections, or special promotions.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 2 -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading">Section 2 - User Consent</h2>
            <p><strong>How Consent is Obtained:</strong> By completing a checkout transaction, validating payment details, placing an order, or arranging shipment/returns, you explicitly authorize Sat Jewels to collect and use your details solely for processing that transaction. If we request your information for secondary purposes (such as email marketing), we will request your direct approval or provide a clear option to decline.</p>
            <p><strong>Revoking Consent:</strong> If you change your mind after opting in, you can withdraw your consent for us to contact you or process your data at any time by emailing <a href="mailto:satjewels31@gmail.com">satjewels31@gmail.com</a> or calling us at +91 76987 27798.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 3 -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading">Section 3 - Legal Disclosure</h2>
            <p>Sat Jewels reserves the right to disclose your personal information if legally required by law enforcement or if you breach our Terms of Service.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 4 -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading">Section 4 - Secure Payment Processing</h2>
            <p>We utilize trusted payment gateways (such as PayPal, Razorpay, and other major processors) to complete transactions safely. Sat Jewels does not store your credit/debit card numbers on our local servers. All transaction details are encrypted under the Payment Card Industry Data Security Standard (PCI-DSS) and are retained only for the duration required to complete your transaction. PCI-DSS standards, maintained by brands like Visa, MasterCard, and American Express, ensure the secure handling of your financial information.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 5 -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading">Section 5 - Third-Party Partners & External Links</h2>
            <p>Third-party service providers engaged by Sat Jewels collect and process your information only to the extent necessary to fulfill their services. However, payment processors maintain their own independent privacy policies. We encourage you to review their terms to understand how your data is handled. Please note that clicking on outbound links on our website may redirect you to external platforms not governed by Sat Jewels' privacy policy.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 6 -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading">Section 6 - Data Security</h2>
            <p>To safeguard your personal information, Sat Jewels follows strict industry safety standards and reasonable precautions to protect data against unauthorized access, loss, misuse, disclosure, or alteration.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 7 -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading">Section 7 - Cookies Policy</h2>
            <p>Sat Jewels utilizes cookies to optimize your browsing session and maintain store functionality. These cookies do not track or identify you on third-party websites.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 8 -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading">Section 8 - Age Limit</h2>
            <p>By utilizing this website, you confirm that you are at least the age of majority in your state or country of residence, or that you have granted consent for any minor dependents under your care to access this site.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 9 -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading">Section 9 - Updates to This Policy</h2>
            <p>We reserve the right to revise this Privacy Policy at any time. Any updates or changes take effect immediately upon posting to our site. If Sat Jewels undergoes a business merger or acquisition, your user data may be transferred to the new owners to ensure uninterrupted service.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 10 -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card contact-card">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading">Section 10 - Contact Information</h2>
            <p>If you wish to view, update, correct, or remove any personal data we hold, submit a concern, or request further information, please contact our Privacy Officer:</p>
            <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:satjewels31@gmail.com">satjewels31@gmail.com</a></p>
            <p><strong>Phone / WhatsApp:</strong> +91 76987 27798</p>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .sat-legal-page-wrap {
        background: #000000;
        color: #ffffff;
        min-height: 100vh;
        padding-bottom: 80px;
        font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    }
    .sat-legal-banner {
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(212, 178, 112, 0.15) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 100%);
        padding: 80px 24px 40px;
        text-align: center;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212, 178, 112, 0.2);
    }
    .sat-legal-banner-inner {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .sat-legal-badge {
        display: inline-block;
        background: rgba(212, 178, 112, 0.15);
        color: #D4B270;
        padding: 6px 18px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(212, 178, 112, 0.3);
    }
    .sat-legal-title {
        font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        font-size: 3rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #ffffff;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .sat-legal-subtitle {
        color: #cccccc;
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .sat-legal-container {
        max-width: 1000px;
        margin: 40px auto 0;
        padding: 0 24px;
    }
    .sat-legal-card {
        background: #0d0d0d;
        border: 1px solid rgba(212, 178, 112, 0.2);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 36px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    }
    .sat-legal-heading {
        font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        color: #D4B270;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .sat-legal-card p {
        color: #d1d5db;
        line-height: 1.8;
        font-size: 1.02rem;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .sat-legal-card p:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .contact-card {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #141414 0%, #0a0a0a 100%);
        border-color: rgba(212, 178, 112, 0.4);
    }
    .contact-card a {
        color: #D4B270;
        text-decoration: underline;
    }
</style>
